<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>My AI Coach - Fitness Support</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0b0f;
      --card: #14141b;
      --text: #f5f5f7;
      --muted: #a1a1aa;
      --accent: #ff3b30;
      --accent-hover: #ff5a52;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", "Segoe UI",
        Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255, 59, 48, 0.12), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #09090c 0%, #0f1015 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(20, 20, 27, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 40px 32px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 59, 48, 0.12);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.2px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .support-box {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .label {
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .email-link {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      word-break: break-word;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .email-link:hover {
      color: var(--accent-hover);
    }

    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 22px;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .cta:hover {
      background: var(--accent-hover);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .card {
        padding: 28px 20px;
        border-radius: 20px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .email-link {
        font-size: 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="container">
    <section class="card">
      <div class="badge">Support</div>
      <h1>My AI Coach - Fitness Support</h1>
      <p>
        Need help with the app, your account, or any feature? We’re here to help.
      </p>
      <p>
        For any questions or support requests, please contact us using the email below.
      </p>

      <div class="support-box">
        <div class="label">Support Email</div>
        <a class="email-link" href="mailto:myaicoachfitness@gmail.com">
          myaicoachfitness@gmail.com
        </a>
        <p>We usually respond within 24–48 hours.</p>
      </div>

      <a class="cta" href="mailto:myaicoachfitness@gmail.com">Contact Support</a>

      <div class="footer">
        © 2026 My AI Coach - Fitness. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>